# Real language grammars + word lists are DESIGN-ONLY local inputs — never committed.
# (Purged from history 2026-07-11; kept locally, gitignored, for building/testing the design.)
# Toy/synthetic fixtures under rust/crates/hc-hybrid/tests/fixtures/ ARE committed.
/samples/data/*-hc.xml
/samples/data/*-words.txt
/samples/data/*.fwdata
/samples/data/*.json
/.worktrees/
/rust/examples/native-abi/csharp/bin/
/rust/examples/native-abi/csharp/obj/

# Per-worktree base/identity metadata written by `rust/tools/pg.ps1 -Mode new-worktree`. Describes
# THIS checkout (which commit it was created from, which managed target it owns), so it must never
# be committed or travel to another worktree -- see rust/tools/_common.ps1's Write-WorktreeMeta.
/.pangloss-worktree.json

# Real-language optimizer/perf run output. These directories are named per language
# (indonesian/, sena/, amharic/, aweti/) and their report.json embeds real-language words and
# analyses, so committing them puts actual-language data and language-named paths in the repo --
# both barred by the synthetic-only rule this suite is built on. Generate them locally and keep them
# locally; commit only synthetic-fixture evidence.
/reports/recipe-optimizer-*/
